                        A workshop pass belongs to one session, not to the event &mdash; so
                        these read per slot
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="hubhead__actions">
                    <div class="toolbar__field">
                        <label class="u-visually-hidden" for="addon-scope">
                            Filter add-ons by date and slot
                        </label>
                        <select class="field__select" id="addon-scope" name="addon-scope"
                                data-addon-scope>
                            <option value="">Every date and slot</option>
                            <option value="day1:slot1">Day 1 &middot; Morning Keynote</option>
                            <option value="day1:slot2">Day 1 &middot; Fintech Panel</option>
                            <option value="day1:slot3">Day 1 &middot; Session 3</option>
                            <option value="day2:slot1">Day 2 &middot; Design Sprint</option>
                            <option value="day2:slot2">Day 2 &middot; Investor Clinic</option>
